# Event Zero hashes and compares file bytes exactly as they are on disk:
# known-bad hash lists, reference manifests, the verification corpus and
# the example reports are all byte-sensitive. Pin LF line endings for text
# so a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf) can never silently rewrite fixture
# bytes and change their hashes (CI verify run #1, 2026-11-23).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artefacts: never subject to line-ending conversion or text diffs.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.com binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.sys binary
*.bin binary
*.pyc binary
fake_malware binary
fixtures/hello_elf binary
